<title>UK: Iceland active after 15 million tax trade.</title>
<headline>Iceland active after 15 million tax trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in frozen foods retailer Iceland Plc were among London's most active on Tuesday, after a large &quot;bed and breakfast&quot; tax trade overnight, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were unchanged at 83p by 1030 GMT after a 15.1 million trade, in which the shares were sold and subsequently bought back at 75p each.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
